{"id":"04668803c3c70a0e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping.md","title":"Rosser Mapping on an Abstract Provability System","display":"df-abstract-rosser-mapping — Rosser Mapping on an Abstract Provability System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping","aliases":["92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping"],"display":"df-abstract-rosser-mapping — Rosser Mapping on an Abstract Provability System","source":"第 XI 章 p. 127（PDF 144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-rosser-mapping — Rosser Mapping on an Abstract Provability System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 127（PDF 144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_MX=(X\\Rightarrow f)\">\\(\\neg_MX=(X\\Rightarrow f)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q:S\\to S\">\\(Q:S\\to S\\)</span>：候选内部运算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M\\)</span> 为下文定义的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}mapping}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\n\\bigl[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow QX\\in P)\n\\land(\\neg_MX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\neg_MQX\\in P)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}mapping}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\n\\bigl[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow QX\\in P)\n\\land(\\neg_MX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\neg_MQX\\in P)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是句子上的运算，不是本库七公理 Robinson 算术集合。它把正证明和反驳分别保送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QX\">\\(QX\\)</span> 与其否定。条件是元语言的可证性封闭，既不要求内部证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\Rightarrow QX\">\\(X\\Rightarrow QX\\)</span>，也不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 标准模型正确。其算术实现由证明序的 Rosser 构造提供。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 p. 127（PDF 144）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_MX=(X\\Rightarrow f)","display":false},{"tex":"Q:S\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}mapping}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\n\\bigl[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow QX\\in P)\n\\land(\\neg_MX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\neg_MQX\\in P)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"QX","display":false},{"tex":"X\\Rightarrow QX","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping]] → [[92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"d4b1b39ab449a633","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping]]"}],"outgoing":["7c85c79ae7f29681"]}